course: dictionary
lesson: 3000
title: Dunk: one word, three meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. To find the right one, look at the words around it. Those words are its context, and they leave clues. Dunk is one of these words.
explain: «Never push, dunk or hold anyone under water, even in fun, because they can hit the side, swallow water and drown.» Dunk sits in a list with push and hold, so it means to put someone under water. This is a safety warning, not a joke.
explain: «Raccoons often dunk food in water even when it is clean.» Here dunk means to dip food quickly into water. Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. If it still makes sense, you have found the right meaning.
fact: Dunk means to dip something quickly into a liquid, like a biscuit into tea or milk.
fact: Dunk also means to push someone or something under water for a moment.
fact: In basketball, a dunk is a shot where the player jumps and pushes the ball down through the hoop.
fact: A slam dunk also means something that is certain to succeed.
fact: Dunk can be a verb (dunk, dunks, dunked, dunking) or a noun (a dunk).
exercise: «Raccoons often dunk food in water.» What does dunk mean here? | To jump and shoot a ball through a hoop | To hit something hard | To sing loudly | *To dip quickly into a liquid
exercise: «Never push, dunk or hold anyone under water.» What does dunk mean? | *To push someone under water for a moment | To dip a biscuit in tea | To dry something off | A basketball shot
exercise: In basketball, what is a dunk? | A foul for holding the ball | A pass to a team mate | *A jump shot where the player pushes the ball down through the hoop | A kind of biscuit
test: Mia dunks a digestive biscuit in her tea. What does dunks mean? | *Dips quickly into a liquid | Throws it away | Burns it | Eats it whole
test: A slam dunk in a match means a win that is certain. What does «slam dunk» mean in everyday talk? | Wet and cold | *Certain to succeed | Very old | Hard to reach
exam: In «Never push, dunk or hold anyone under water», what does dunk mean? | To jump and shoot a basketball | To win easily | To dip a biscuit in tea | *To push someone under water for a moment
